{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>日本神級折疊枕墊爆紅！</h2>\n<p>去旅行最怕睡不好！日本Bodydoctor與枕頭專家まくら株式会社合作推出天然乳膠枕頭調整墊「TOPUP」，只要墊在原有枕頭下，便能即時調整高度與觸感；更可捲起帶走，成為旅途中救回睡眠的隨身神器。\n</p>\n<h2>100%天然乳膠製成</h2>\n<p>「TOPUP」以100%天然乳膠製成，不會過度下陷，也不會過分反彈，能提供恰到好處的支撐與柔軟感。芯材於馬來西亞製造，再於日本縫製，品質有一定保證。產品重量僅約0.4公斤，可輕鬆捲起放入行李箱。無論是酒店、回鄉探親，還是露營、車中泊，都能隨時拿出來使用，解決「枕頭不合適」的煩惱。</p>\n<h2>可按需要自由變化用法</h2>\n<p>「TOPUP」最大賣點，是可按需要自由變化用法：枕頭太低時，可墊在枕頭下方加高；枕頭太硬時，可疊在上方增加柔軟感。側睡人士可將它對摺使用，厚度約5厘米；兩塊疊起則可當矮枕頭，適合兒童或喜歡低枕的人。旅行時捲起即可放入行李，隨時改善睡眠。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508242434713044_1706597866afec8b97bd79.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508242434713044_1706597866afec8b97bd79.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508242742934540_861150916afec8bbbbbac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508242742934540_861150916afec8bbbbbac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508242891226628_3535485636afec8bd582e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508242891226628_3535485636afec8bd582e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508243077653913_8246015536afec8bf2b9ee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508243077653913_8246015536afec8bf2b9ee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df6mehxE6O2/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:15:37.921817+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":499,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:57:21.468924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:09:02.618407+00:00","content_hash":"2b47fbb026f1be951923882d56d67b91406de4789ba4b28f1699d64836fbcaa6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}